# Long-Range (ADR 0017)

`FEATURE_LONG_RANGE` / `feature_long_range` stays **off** in production JSON. Long-Range / weak-subjectivity work is **lab-only** until ADR 0017 is complete on disk.

- Do not mix Long-Range into the audit-pin mesh or `v1.3.1339-tip-v2-industrial`.
- Experimental labs must not be reported as industrial evidence.
- Tip-safety remains ADR 0001 / bounded `AncestryWindow` until 0017 lands.

```json
// ❌ BAD (prod)
{ "feature_long_range": true }

// ✅ GOOD (prod)
{ "feature_long_range": false }
```
